SCOPE

This license covers the material created by the authors: the compositing
and normalization pipeline, the inserted visual cues, the prompts, the
annotations, and the analysis code in this repository.

It does not cover the underlying source photographs of the SHARE dataset.
Those were retrieved through web image search, and any rights in them
remain with their respective holders. The authors make no licensing claim
over them. The photographs are distributed only as part of the SHARE
dataset and must not be redistributed separately from it.

USE

SHARE and this code are provided for non-commercial research use.

Rights holders who wish to have an image removed may contact
javad.ism@kaist.ac.kr. Removals are recorded in the dataset card so that
affected results remain traceable.
